{%- comment -%}
  Portal 定制:购物车抽屉推荐商品(Section Rendering API 渲染目标)。

  本 section 不挂载在任何模板中,仅由 assets/portal-cart-recommendations.js
  通过原生推荐接口请求:
  /recommendations/products?section_id=portal-cart-recommendations&intent=related&product_id=...
  使用原生 recommendations 对象渲染真实商品;无推荐结果时输出为空,
  由注入脚本隐藏整个模块。卡片样式由 snippets/portal-cart-recommendations.liquid
  提供(注入目标位于购物车抽屉内)。
{%- endcomment -%}

{% # theme-check-disable ValidScopedCSSClass %}
{% # 卡片样式类集中定义在 snippets/portal-cart-recommendations.liquid 的 stylesheet 中,本文件仅输出结构 %}


{%- if recommendations.performed and recommendations.products_count > 0 -%}
  <div
    class="portal-cart-recommendations__content"
    data-portal-cart-recs-content
  >
    <h3 class="portal-cart-recommendations__heading">
      {{ 'portal.cart_recommendations.title' | t }}
    </h3>
    <ul
      class="portal-cart-recommendations__list"
      role="list"
    >
      {%- comment -%}
        不在循环上硬编码数量:注入脚本已在推荐接口 URL 中传入 limit,
        这里渲染接口实际返回的全部商品,保持与 data-limit 一致。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- for recommended_product in recommendations.products -%}
        <li class="portal-cart-recommendations__item">
          <a
            class="portal-cart-recommendations__media"
            href="{{ recommended_product.url }}"
            tabindex="-1"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            {%- if recommended_product.featured_image -%}
              {{
                recommended_product.featured_image
                | image_url: width: 160
                | image_tag:
                  loading: 'lazy',
                  widths: '80, 120, 160',
                  sizes: '64px',
                  alt: recommended_product.featured_image.alt
              }}
            {%- endif -%}
          </a>
          <div class="portal-cart-recommendations__info">
            <a
              class="portal-cart-recommendations__title"
              href="{{ recommended_product.url }}"
            >
              {{- recommended_product.title | escape -}}
            </a>
            {%- if recommended_product.available == false -%}
              <span class="portal-cart-recommendations__price portal-cart-recommendations__price--sold-out">
                {{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}
              </span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="portal-cart-recommendations__price">
                {{- recommended_product.price | money -}}
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
          {%- comment -%}
          仅单默认变体且可售的商品提供原生快捷加购(POST /cart/add.js),
          多变体商品跳转商品页选择规格,避免误加购错误变体。
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if recommended_product.has_only_default_variant and recommended_product.available -%}
            <button
              class="portal-cart-recommendations__add button-unstyled"
              type="button"
              data-portal-rec-add
              data-variant-id="{{ recommended_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}"
              aria-label="{{ 'portal.cart_recommendations.add_to_cart' | t: title: recommended_product.title | escape }}"
            >
              <span class="svg-wrapper">
                {{- 'icon-plus.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
              </span>
            </button>
          {%- endif -%}
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:portal.cart_recommendations_name",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
